### Test 1: User asking about manager (with user context)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/agent_httptrigger HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Who is my manager?",
  "parameters": {
    "user_id": "SHSU",
    "user_full_name": "HSU, Susan"
  }
}

